    whenToUse: |-
      Automatically populates AI-KIDO Memory Bank from code/context when documents are missing or invalid. Orchestrates truth-evaluator, raci-delegator, and expert personas to create compliant documentation. INVOKE AT END OF PROCESS after final gap report, not immediately upon detection.
    groups:
      - read
      - edit
      - command
