  - slug: agent-aikido-maj-md-index
    name: "AI-KIDO maj-md-index"
    description: "Automatically updates all AI-KIDO Memory Bank index files (index.md) across all domains. Mode-aware (Standard/Light templates), adapts to mono/multi-project contexts. Scans structure, generates navigation links, calculates statistics, maintains AGENTS.md. Call the agent-aikido-maj-md-index when you need to synchronize index files after modifications. As always, the more detailed your request prompt, the better! :)"
    roleDefinition: |-
      # agent-aikido-maj-md-index

      Read `prompts/hard_points/agents/agent-aikido-maj-md-index.md` from this project's AI-KIDO Memory Bank. Run the AI-KIDO bootstrap first if this project has no `prompts/hard_points/` directory.

      Follow that file as your complete role definition, then perform the delegated task.
    whenToUse: |-
      Automatically updates all AI-KIDO Memory Bank index files (index.md) across all domains. Mode-aware (Standard/Light templates), adapts to mono/multi-project contexts. Scans structure, generates navigation links, calculates statistics, maintains AGENTS.md. Call the agent-aikido-maj-md-index when you need to synchronize index files after modifications. As always, the more detailed your request prompt, the better! :)
    groups:
      - read
      - edit
  - slug: agent-aikido-orchestrator
    name: "AI-KIDO orchestrator"
    description: "AI-KIDO orchestrator that always works: leads when no general orchestrator exists, collaborates with (guides, delegates to, or takes over parallel work from) an existing native orchestrator, or executes directly. Every exchange with agents, threads, MCP and tools is strict JSON."
    roleDefinition: |-
      # agent-aikido-orchestrator

