    whenToUse: |-
      AI-KIDO orchestrator that always works: leads when no general orchestrator exists, collaborates with (guides, delegates to, or takes over parallel work from) an existing native orchestrator, or executes directly. Every exchange with agents, threads, MCP and tools is strict JSON.
    groups:
      - read
      - edit
      - command
      - mcp
  - slug: agent-aikido-projet-index
    name: "AI-KIDO projet-index"
    description: "Fast service to search and locate a file or directory by name, type, directory or path. Generates and maintains the project tree as a scalable multi-index JSON V3.1 (prompts/hard_points/system/structure/) via parallelized bash scripts. Answers project structure questions instantly. Targeted incremental updates."
